Package: zerosend
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: InstantComet <10364622+InstantComet@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pil (>= 9.4), python3-cryptography, iproute2, fonts-dejavu-core
Conflicts: cz-beam
Replaces: cz-beam
Homepage: https://github.com/InstantComet/zerosend
Description: LocalSend-compatible file sharing for the M5Stack CardputerZero
 ZeroSend sends and receives files and text messages with LocalSend apps on
 phones and computers on the same network (LocalSend protocol v2, HTTPS).
 It asks on screen before accepting files and saves them to ~/Downloads.
 Only runs while the app is open. Unofficial: not affiliated with or
 endorsed by the LocalSend project.
